\
This project analyses how Fulham FC managed their annual spend and how it impacted performance during the 2024/25 English Premier League season. Using a combination of SQL, Excel and Tableau, this project provides insights into salary structure, spend efficiency, and key ROI metrics.\
\
By highlighting a key group of similar competitors, this project provides guidelines for Fulham to improve performance with regard to their financial position and offers suggestions for further research.\
